From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 15:26:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 091/111] Typing or selecting in the editor clears the preview
 selection

In the Split view a preview selection stayed after the user selected or
typed in the editor, and Copy then copied the preview's text instead of
what was selected last. The preview now remembers where the editor's
cursor and selection were when its selection started; once they move,
by keyboard or mouse, Shift+arrows or Select All in the editor, the
preview selection goes and Copy takes the editor's.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

